\[
\begin{array}{r|rrrr}
1 & 1 & -3 & -1 & 3 \\
  &   & 1 & -2 & -3 \\
\hline
  & 1 & -2 & -3 & 0 \\
\end{array}
\]
This gives us:
\[
f(a) = (a - 1)(a^2 - 2a - 3)
