The rotation of a complex number \( z \) around another complex number \( w \) by an angle \( \theta \) can be expressed as:
\[
z' = w + (z - w) e^{i\theta}
\]
where \( e^{i\theta} = \cos(\theta) + i\sin(\theta) \).

