### Step 3: Detailed Calculations
The unit square is defined by the inequalities:
\[
0 < x < 1 \quad \text{and} \quad 0 < y < 1
\]

The condition \(y - x > \frac{1}{4}\) can be rewritten as:
\[
y > x + \frac{1}{4}
