#### Step 3.5: Finalize the Projection
The projection becomes:
\[
\text{proj}_{\begin{pmatrix} v_1 \\ -7 - v_1 \end{pmatrix}} \overrightarrow{BA} = \frac{8v_1 + 14}{2v_1^2 + 14v_1 + 49} \begin{pmatrix} v_1 \\ -7 - v_1 \end{pmatrix}
